   "html": "לִישָּׁנָא אַחֲרִינָא: אָמְרִין לַהּ, <span class=\"rif-covered rif-parallel\" data-rif-ref=\"15b:3\">אָמַר רָבָא: לָא תֵּימָא טַעְמָא דְּאָמַר</span>לֵיהּ <span class=\"rif-covered rif-parallel\" data-rif-ref=\"15b:3\"><span class=\"rif-variant\" data-subtype=\"orthographic\" data-rif=\"ואינן\">״וְהִינָּן</span>לְפָנֶיךָ״</span>הוּא דְּאָסוּר, <span class=\"rif-covered rif-parallel\" data-rif-ref=\"15b:3\">אֲבָל אֲמַר</span>לֵיהּ <span class=\"rif-covered rif-parallel\" data-rif-ref=\"15b:3\">״הֵן לְפָנֶיךָ <span class=\"rif-variant\" data-subtype=\"substitution\" data-rif=\"ויבא\">שֶׁיָּבֹא</span>אַבָּא וְיֹאכַל״</span>מוּתָּר. <span class=\"rif-covered rif-parallel\" data-rif-ref=\"15b:3\">אֶלָּא אֲפִילּוּ אָמַר</span>לֵיהּ <span class=\"rif-covered rif-parallel\" data-rif-ref=\"15b:3\">״הֵן לְפָנֶיךָ</span>יָבֹא אַבָּא וְיֹאכַל״ <span class=\"rif-covered rif-parallel\" data-rif-ref=\"15b:3\">אָסוּר. מַאי טַעְמָא סְעוּדָתוֹ מוֹכַחַת עָלָיו.</span>",
